Now we need to ensure we don't attempt to stage_schedule_candidate before candidate_prepared, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_loaded, loading_container_leg_linked, candidate_task_profile_linked, not origin_leg_loaded, not candidate_staged_for_loading. We'll do after loading container.

Now we need to ensure we don't attempt to verify_loading_profile_nominal before candidate_staged_for_loading, candidate_skill_certificate_linked, candidate_operator_linked, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_leg_linked, not destination_leg_loaded, not candidate_loading_verified. We'll do after staging.

Now we need to ensure we don't attempt to establish_clearance_nominal before candidate_loading_verified, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_leg_linked, not origin_leg_loaded, not destination_leg_loaded, not candidate_clearance_established. We'll do after verification.

Now we need to ensure we don't attempt to attach_service_window before candidate_clearance_established, route_sequence_context_set, service_window_available. We'll do after establishing clearance.

Now we need to ensure we don't attempt to validate_route_sequence before candidate_clearance_established, route_sequence_context_set, candidate_service_window_linked, candidate_origin_availability_linked, candidate_destination_availability_linked, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, candidate_task_profile_linked, not route_sequence_validated. We'll do after attaching service window.

Now we need to ensure we don't attempt to finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation before candidate_clearance_established, route_sequence_validated, not candidate_finalized. We'll do after validation.

