Thus we need to allocate distinct vehicles to each candidate at the time of allocation, but we can reuse after dispatch.

Thus we need to plan vehicle assignments:

We have three vehicles: alpha, beta, gamma.

We need to allocate to four candidates total (origin, destination, shift_alpha, shift_beta). We'll need to allocate sequentially, releasing after dispatch.

